WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.659
Identify agricultural products produced in Ghana and explain their value.

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:11.133
Ghanaian agriculture provides foods and goods such as yam, cocoyam, rice, poultry and

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:16.303
cocoa products including chocolate. Farmers and workers help supply our homes and

00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:16.733
markets.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:21.967
Using and appreciating local agricultural products supports livelihoods and jobs.

00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:27.731
Eating a variety of safe local foods helps families enjoy a balanced diet.

00:00:28.533 --> 00:00:33.212
List five products found in your local market and ask which are grown or produced in

00:00:33.212 --> 00:00:33.504
Ghana.
